# .cursorrules

## Stack
- Plain HTML, CSS, JavaScript — no framework, no build step
- Hosted on GitHub Pages at fatimaasghar26.github.io/Portfolio

## Conventions
- Commit messages follow Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:, style:)
- No inline styles — all CSS in dedicated stylesheets
- Vanilla JS only, no jQuery or frameworks unless explicitly added here
- Project links must point to individual GitHub repos, not the generic profile

## Known issues to fix
- Skills section is missing React, Node.js, MongoDB, Express
- Project links currently route to generic GitHub profile instead of specific repos